},{"type":"html","id":"gg8JU3Hx6uH_text","label":"gg8JU3Hx6uH_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#0C0000;\">\"Really lovely collection. The boys wear really stood out, a little different with the colour pops. A stylish twist on a classic style.\"</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVuX3A_Ki7_text","label":"ggVuX3A_Ki7_text","default":"<p><strong>Emma McMenemy,&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Content Creator</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggA33FDZEAG_text","label":"ggA33FDZEAG_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#0C0000;\">\"These are the most beautiful, luxurious, sustainable pieces. They have a wonderful family design history and make the perfect hand-me-downs.\"</span></p>"}],
